  "body": "Situated in the highly sought-after Mairangi Bay, this charming home is elevated on a 728sqm (approx) freehold title, well orientated for the sun, has a lovely outlook and enjoys natural light. The home has been modernised and effortlessly combines modern living with everyday comfort. \r\n\r\nThe main, kitchen, dining, and living areas create a perfect space for both family gatherings and entertaining friends. Step outside to the large decks which flow seamlessly from multiple areas of the home, ideal for enjoying sunny barbecues, the established gardens, or simply relaxing while taking in the outlook. \r\n\r\nThe kitchen is fully equipped with high-quality appliances, making cooking and meal preparation effortless. The laundry/scullery adjoining the kitchen adds useful storage and functionality. Two heat pumps, together with the sunny north/east orientation, provide good year-round comfort. \r\n\r\nThe home comprises 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and two living areas including a semi self contained area on the lower level with its own external access, bedroom, bathroom and living area which is ideal for kids, guest or extended family. The layout provided flexibility for family life, different generations, working from home or simply having both social and quieter spaces.\r\n\r\nThe home has a lovely quiet, private and established feel, despite being so convenient to schools, the village and beautiful Mairangi Bay beach. Close proximity to Rangitoto College, Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and St John's School. Off-street parking for multiple cars plus a double garage.\r\n\r\nThis property offers a lifestyle of convenience, relaxation, and leisure in one of the area's most desirable locations.",
